(2, 'a8b649865058', NULL, 'Bienvenue chez NorthStars ✨', 'standard', 'contact.northstars@proton.me', 'NorthStars', 'draft', 'contact.northstars@proton.me', 'NorthStars', 'On est super contents de t’accueillir dans la communauté !', '{\"content\":{\"type\":\"container\",\"columnLayout\":false,\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"image\":{\"src\":null,\"display\":\"scale\"},\"styles\":{\"block\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\"}},\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"container\",\"columnLayout\":false,\"orientation\":\"horizontal\",\"image\":{\"src\":null,\"display\":\"scale\"},\"styles\":{\"block\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#ffffff\"}},\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"container\",\"columnLayout\":false,\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"image\":{\"src\":null,\"display\":\"scale\"},\"styles\":{\"block\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\"}},\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"spacer\",\"styles\":{\"block\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\",\"height\":\"30px\"}}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"link\":\"\",\"src\":\"http://localhost/northstars/wp-content/plugins/mailpoet/assets/img/blank_templates/fake-logo.png\",\"alt\":\"Fake logo\",\"fullWidth\":false,\"width\":\"598px\",\"height\":\"71px\",\"styles\":{\"block\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: left\\\">Hello [subscriber:firstname | default:subscriber],</p>\\n<p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Bienvenue chez </span><strong><span>NorthStars</span></strong><span> ✨</span><br><span>On est super contents de t&rsquo;accueillir dans la communaut&eacute; !</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Ici, notre mission est simple : t&rsquo;aider &agrave; aborder sereinement ton entr&eacute;e &agrave; </span><strong><span>Epitech</span></strong><span>. Que tu sois en pleine r&eacute;flexion ou d&eacute;j&agrave; admis(e), tu trouveras des conseils concrets, des retours d&rsquo;exp&eacute;rience et des ressources utiles pour bien d&eacute;marrer.</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>On va te partager :</